{"id":"n65533-1-13","stage":1,"title":"방향 · 方向","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65533-1-13-1","ko":"돌아가면서 자기 소개를 하도록 합시다.","zh":"我们轮流做自我介绍吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돌아가면서","meaning":"依次，逐次","explanation":"돌아가다：依次，逐次；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"16","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자기","meaning":"自己","explanation":"자기：自己","readings":[{"term":"자기","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57311","senseId":"1","lemma":"자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소개를","meaning":"介绍","explanation":"소개：介绍；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소개","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64301","senseId":"2","lemma":"소개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하도록","meaning":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합시다.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"依次，逐次","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"按顺序一个接一个进行。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"1c11f639d43037d2","term":"자기","zh":"自己","audio":"/audio/1c11f639d43037d2110a.mp3","entryId":"57311","definition":"自身。","pronunciation":["자기"]},{"id":"7367283c48b6e4d5","term":"소개","zh":"介绍","audio":"/audio/7367283c48b6e4d56094.mp3","entryId":"64301","definition":"在互不认识的人之间建立联系，使双方相识来往。","pronunciation":["소개"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示使做前面的行动或使成为前面所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2c4eac6e9972b0778cfe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65533-1-13-2","ko":"저부터 시계 방향으로 돌아가죠.","zh":"从我开始，按顺时针方向轮流来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저부터","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시계","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방향으로","meaning":"方向","explanation":"방향：方向；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"방향","audio":"/audio/d7895d7647666fe00cec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65533","senseId":"1","lemma":"방향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌아가죠.","meaning":"依次，逐次","explanation":"돌아가다：依次，逐次；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"16","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"d7895d7647666fe0","term":"방향","zh":"方向","audio":"/audio/d7895d7647666fe00cec.mp3","entryId":"65533","definition":"对着某个地点或方位的朝向。","pronunciation":["방향"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"依次，逐次","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"按顺序一个接一个进行。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/348cbbe113